---
title: Job Progress Streaming (Backend)
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as SSE Client
    participant API as /recognition/jobs/{id}/stream
    participant JobRepo as JobRepository
    participant ScanRepo as ScanQueueRepository
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Worker as ScanWorker / Job Handlers

    Note over Client,DB: Legend: ENTRY = external entrypoint, Dashed arrow = optional wiring
    Note over Client,DB: Mini-map: ENTRY: GET /recognition/jobs/{id}/stream -> JobRepository + ScanQueueRepository, Code: recognition/interface_adapters/http/routers/analyze.py

    Client->>API: ENTRY: GET /recognition/jobs/{id}/stream

    loop Poll (100ms)
        API->>JobRepo: get(job_id)
        JobRepo->>DB: SELECT identity_scan_jobs / identity_clustering_jobs
        API->>ScanRepo: get_job_item_status_counts(job_id)
        ScanRepo->>DB: SELECT identity_scan_job_items (counts)
        alt Progress changed or heartbeat
            API-->>Client: SSE "progress" {status, completed, total, phase, images_processed, faces_found}
        end
    end

    Worker->>DB: Update job progress (scan items / clustering jobs)
    API-->>Client: SSE "done" when status completed/failed
